  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>By using integrating by parts, i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Again, applying&nbsp;integrating by parts, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
